  "research_status": "COMPLETE — all 24 episodes of Kuroshitsuji (Black Butler) Season 1 classified canon/filler (no mixed episodes found). The series follows the manga through the Black Butler and Red Butler arcs (episodes 1-6) and the Indian Butler arc (13-15), then diverges into a fully anime-original story for the rest — the manga author reportedly wanted more screen time for Sebastian than the source material's pacing allowed. Two sources (IsItFiller, a general aggregate search) confirm episode 1 as canon; a third (QuoteTheAnime) calls it filler instead — resolved as canon, 2 vs 1, see that episode's own status_note. IsItFiller's own numbering runs past episode 24 into what is actually Season 2 (a separate, also fully anime-original continuation) — disregarded as out of this project's scope, since this catalog entry (AniList id 4898) covers only Season 1's 24 episodes. No episode titles included — handled automatically by load_episodes.py's new auto-backfill (#103) once loaded. Complete, gap-free, non-overlapping coverage of 1-24 confirmed before writing this file.",
